heatre and security can be planned during design, so wiring and controls are hidden neatly.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Do you design farmhouses as luxury homes too?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Many Chhattarpur clients use their farmhouse as a main home, and we design it with the same detail as a city residence.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>Space, Comfort and Character</h2>\n            <p>A large home should still feel personal. Our luxury home interior designs bring warmth and character to every room, however big.</p><p>Planning a luxury home or estate near Chhattarpur? <a href=\"/chhattarpur/contact\">Contact 9th Corner</a> for a private meeting.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}